WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.767
Your next idea is ready.

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.833
But you're still switching apps,

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.867
hunting through menus,

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.400
and repeating the same steps.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.600
DCC MCP connects AI assistants

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.700
to creative software,

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:11.833
bringing your instructions

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:13.000
into the tools you use.

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:15.767
Model in Blender.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:18.533
Build procedural effects in Houdini.

00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:20.700
Assemble scenes in Maya.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.800
Your assistant discovers available tools,

00:00:23.967 --> 00:00:25.267
reads the application state,

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:26.033
takes action,

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.133
and checks the result.

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:30.333
The output can be an editable scene,

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.700
material, or project,

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.533
ready for your next creative decision.

00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:36.367
An open source ecosystem.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:39.133
One shared connection across applications,

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:40.333
with reusable skills

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:41.633
for familiar workflows.

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:45.567
See what ran. Check what changed.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:47.567
Keep your focus on the shot,

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:49.267
the details, and the idea.

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:54.700
DCC MCP. Connect AI to creation.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.367
Explore the examples on our website,

00:00:57.433 --> 00:00:58.867
and start your first workflow.
